SCOPE

This license covers the original content of this repository: the profile,
work history, lessons, ratings, tools, and the 27 skills under skills/.

It does NOT cover third-party skills. Those are referenced in
skills/manifest.json with their upstream sources and are fetched by
tools/install-third-party.sh — they are not redistributed here and remain
under their own licenses (Apache-2.0, MIT, and others as noted).

FACTUAL CONTENT

This repository describes a real person and real businesses. Facts stated here
were accurate as of the dates given in each file. Do not present adapted or
derived versions as statements made by Vishal Agarwal, and do not use his name,
likeness, or business details to imply endorsement.
